parameters.text:
=Write a cold email to a local business using the lead data below.

Business: {{ $('Lead Webhook').item.json.business_name }}
What they do: {{ $('Lead Webhook').item.json.category }} ({{ $('Lead Webhook').item.json.niche }})
Website: {{ $('Lead Webhook').item.json.website }}
Location: {{ $('Lead Webhook').item.json.address }}

My offer: I build fast, mobile-friendly websites for local service businesses that are losing mobile visitors.

Sender identity (may be empty — omit any empty field):
Name: {{ $('Lead Webhook').item.json.sender_name }}
Business: {{ $('Lead Webhook').item.json.sender_business_name }}
Postal address: {{ $('Lead Webhook').item.json.sender_address }}

Unsubscribe (may be empty — omit any empty field):
Text: {{ $('Lead Webhook').item.json.unsubscribe_text }}
URL: {{ $('Lead Webhook').item.json.unsubscribe_url }}

If sender name and postal address were provided, end the email with a short signature and the unsubscribe line ("<unsubscribe text>: <url>"). Omit any line whose value is empty.

